jobs and creator sales without forcing every interaction through one marketplace company."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["That does not make trade automatic. Markets run on trust, settlement, discovery, dispute handling and habit. A signed event is powerful, but it is not a customer-service department."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"h2","attributes":{"id":"what-is-being-sold"},"children":["What is being sold"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["Start with the object. Is NostrApps category — Marketplaces about a product listing, a service, a marketplace, a funding path, a data vending job, a content sale or a payment workflow? Each one needs a different kind of proof."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["NIP-15, NIP-90, zaps and wallet connections are useful only when you can see the actual trade. Who offers? Who pays? Who fulfills? Who can verify the result?"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"h2","attributes":{"id":"payments-are-not-the-whole-story"},"children":["Payments are not the whole story"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["Nostr and Lightning make small payments feel native, especially through zaps. But commerce is not just moving sats. It is the surrounding agreement: description, price, delivery, reputation, refund expectations, privacy and whether the buyer can tell a real seller from a glossy fake."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["NostrApps category — Marketplaces should therefore connect money to context. The best market pages make the flow understandable before they get excited about the rails."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"h2","attributes":{"id":"where-crays-can-use-it"},"children":["Where Crays can use it"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["For Crays, commerce touches creators, venues, awards, access, premium content, sponsorships and project markets. The interesting part is not building another storefront. It is letting identity, taste, payment and public proof support a better transaction."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["That is why this shelf sits beside Wallets and Governance. Money needs value flow. Markets need rules. Reputation needs memory."]},"\n              ",{"tag":"h2","attributes":{"id":"what-to-do-with-it"},"children":["What to do with it"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["Do not treat NostrApps category — Marketplaces as a loose bookmark. Use it as a decision point: which idea does it explain, which page should you read next and which claim needs checking before you repeat it?"]},"\n              ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["The useful habit is simple. Read the plain explanation, follow one nearby link and come back with a sharper question. That is how a large Nostr archive turns into a working map instead of a scattered set of browser tabs."]},"\n\n",{"tag":"div","attributes":{"className":"crays-article-end"},"children":["\n              ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"/nostr/"},"children":["Back to the Crays Nostr page"]},"\n            "]},"\n          "]},"\n        "]},"\n      "]},"\n    "]},"\n\n\n      ",{"tag":"section","attributes":{"className":"crays-nostr-page-closeout","data-crays-page-closeout":"true","aria-label":"Page closing navigation"},"children":["\n        ",{"tag":"section","attributes":{"className":"crays-nostr-hub-image-band crays-nostr-apps-collage crays-nostr-page-closeout-collage crays-nostr-page-closeout-collage--route","id":"page-closeout-commerce-apps-research-nostrapps-category-marketplaces-route-collage","aria-label":"Commerce route collage"},"children":["\n          ",{"tag":"div","attributes":{"className":"crays-article-shell crays-nostr-hub-image-band__grid"},"children":["\n              ",{"tag":"figure","attributes":{"className":"is-wide"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attributes":{"src":"/assets/stock-images/nostr-hub-separators/nostr-sep